  "description": "Interface sounds for presses, switches, dialogs, notices, success and errors, in three sets: **Ripple** (soft water drops), **Glass** (bright chimes) and **Driftwood** (warm marimba and wood). **Off until the person using the app turns them on**, and each person can mix and match: a different set, or silence, for each sound. Their choices are remembered on that device.",
